# observability.md compliance signal — pull-only metrics policy.
#
# The rule (CRITICAL) forbids pushing metrics via OTLP. Hits below indicate a
# project re-introduced the OtlpMeterRegistry classpath dependency or
# explicitly re-enabled the push exporter, both of which silently double-
# publish in production.

io\.micrometer\.registry\.otlp\.OtlpMeterRegistry
management\.otlp\.metrics\.export\.enabled\s*=\s*true
